<title>JAPAN: Honma Golf to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Honma Golf to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honma Golf Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it planned to repurchase up to 3.10934 million of its shares and alter company regulations to proceed swiftly with the repurchase.</p>
<p>Honma Golf is a leading maker of golf-related products, including golf wear.</p>
</text>
